{"meta":{"id":"java-jpa-spring-data-queries","title":"Spring Data JPA viết truy vấn thế nào — derived query, @Query JPQL và native, @Modifying, Specification; khi nào bỏ repository để viết SQL trực tiếp","track":"java","topic":"jpa-hibernate","tags":["spring-data-jpa","jpql","derived-query","specification","native-query"],"type":"question","level":"junior","domain":[],"asked_at":[],"minutes":6,"status":"done","verified_on":"2026-11-11","private":false,"related":["java-jpa-projections","java-jpa-n-plus-one","java-jpa-keyset-pagination","java-sql-index-plan"],"srs":true,"sources":[],"layer":"theory","askedAt":[],"verifiedOn":"2026-11-11","ngVersion":null},"intro":"","sections":[{"key":"question","label":"Câu hỏi","role":"prompt","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Trong Spring Data JPA có những cách nào để viết truy vấn? Bạn chọn cách nào cho màn tìm kiếm khách hàng có 8 tiêu chí lọc tuỳ chọn? <code>@Modifying</code> dùng khi nào và có bẫy gì?</p>\n"},{"key":"quick","label":"Câu trả lời tốt nhất","role":"primary","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Bốn mức, từ đơn giản tới linh hoạt. <strong>Derived query</strong> — Spring sinh truy vấn từ tên method: <code>findByStatusAndBranchCode(...)</code> — hợp cho truy vấn ngắn 1–2 điều kiện, tên dài hơn thế là dấu hiệu nên đổi cách. <strong><code>@Query</code> JPQL</strong> — truy vấn tường minh trên entity, có thể kèm <code>JOIN FETCH</code> hoặc trả projection/record. <strong><code>@Query(nativeQuery = true)</code></strong> — khi cần tính năng riêng của DB (window function, hint, upsert). <strong>Specification / Querydsl / Criteria</strong> — cho <strong>lọc động</strong>: màn tìm kiếm 8 tiêu chí tuỳ chọn tôi dùng Specification, mỗi tiêu chí một hàm trả <code>null</code> khi trống rồi ghép bằng <code>and</code>. <code>@Modifying</code> dùng cho <code>UPDATE</code>/<code>DELETE</code> bằng JPQL; bẫy là nó <strong>bỏ qua persistence context</strong> — entity đã nạp không được cập nhật — nên thêm <code>clearAutomatically = true</code>, và nó không kích hoạt <code>@Version</code>, callback hay cascade. Với báo cáo phức tạp, tôi viết SQL qua <code>JdbcClient</code> thay vì ép vào JPA.</p>\n"},{"key":"deep","label":"Trả lời đầy đủ","role":"detail","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<h3>Derived query</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"java\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CustomerRepository</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JpaRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Customer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">JpaSpecificationExecutor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Customer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Optional&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Customer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findByCifNo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cifNo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Customer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findTop10ByBranchCodeOrderByCreatedAtDesc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">branch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    boolean</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> existsByPhone</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">phone</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    long</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> countByStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(CustomerStatus </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>Spring kiểm tra tên method lúc khởi động — sai tên thuộc tính là app không start (tốt). Nhưng <code>findByStatusAndBranchCodeAndCreatedAtBetweenAndSegmentIn</code> thì không ai đọc nổi.</p>\n<h3>@Query</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"java\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    select new com.mybank.customer.CustomerRow(c.id, c.fullName, c.cifNo, b.name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    from Customer c join c.branch b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    where c.status = :status and b.region = :region</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Page</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CustomerRow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findRows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(CustomerStatus status, String region, Pageable pageable);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>Với <code>Page</code>, Spring chạy thêm câu <code>count</code> — trên bảng lớn có thể rất chậm; cân nhắc <code>Slice</code> (không đếm tổng) hoặc keyset pagination.</p>\n<h3>Lọc động với Specification</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"java\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Specification</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Customer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> nameContains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String q) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isBlank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (root, cq, cb) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">like</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fullName\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"%\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toLowerCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Specification</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Customer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inBranch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String code) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (root, cq, cb) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">equal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"branch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), code);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// chi ghep tieu chi co gia tri (Spring Data JPA 4 chat che hon voi null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">List&#x3C;Specification&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Customer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> parts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Stream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nameContains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">inBranch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">branch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hasStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Objects</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nonNull)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Page&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Customer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> page </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repo.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Specification.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">allOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(parts), PageRequest.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Sort.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"createdAt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">descending</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>Lưu ý hiệu năng: <code>like '%...%'</code> không dùng được B-tree index — tìm theo tên trên bảng lớn cần full-text search hoặc trigram index.</p>\n<h3>@Modifying</h3>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"java\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Modifying</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clearAutomatically</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">flushAutomatically</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"update Card c set c.status = 'LOCKED' where c.expiryDate &#x3C; :today and c.status = 'ACTIVE'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lockExpired</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(LocalDate today);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p>Phải chạy trong transaction. Không qua dirty checking nên không tăng <code>@Version</code>, không chạy <code>@PreUpdate</code>, không ghi audit tự động của Hibernate Envers.</p>\n<h3>Khi nào bỏ JPA</h3>\n<p>Báo cáo nhiều join, aggregate, window function: viết SQL qua <code>JdbcClient</code>/jOOQ — đọc rõ, tối ưu bằng EXPLAIN được, không nạp entity thừa. JPA mạnh nhất ở phần ghi và nạp aggregate theo id.</p>\n"},{"key":"real","label":"Thực tế trong dự án của tôi","role":"personal","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ngữ cảnh</strong> dựng từ backend Spring Boot của các dự án bạn đã tham gia (vai trò chính của bạn là Angular) — ghi rõ phần tự làm và phần chỉ phối hợp. <strong>Tình huống điển hình</strong> là tình huống hay gặp ở backend ngân hàng, bảo hiểm do app biên soạn để luyện cách kể; số liệu là ví dụ minh hoạ. Chưa làm trực tiếp thì kể là đã tìm hiểu hoặc thử ở dự án luyện tập, đừng nhận là đã làm ở công ty.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Ngữ cảnh:</strong> backend ngân hàng A dùng <code>JdbcTemplate</code>/<code>SimpleJdbcCall</code> gọi stored procedure thay vì Spring Data JPA.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Đã làm:</strong> so sánh khi được hỏi: derived query cho truy vấn đơn giản, <code>@Query</code> JPQL/native khi phức tạp, <code>@Modifying</code> cho cập nhật hàng loạt; dự án chọn proc vì logic nghiệp vụ và báo cáo đã nằm sẵn trong DB.</li>\n<li><strong>Kết quả:</strong> giải thích được lựa chọn của dự án và đánh đổi (khó test, logic phân tán).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tình huống điển hình:</strong> Repository có method tên dài 9 điều kiện <code>findByStatusAndBranchAndCreatedAtBetweenAnd...</code>, khó đọc và không dùng lại được cho màn lọc tuỳ chọn. Đội giữ derived query cho truy vấn 1–2 điều kiện, chuyển màn lọc sang Specification ghép điều kiện, truy vấn báo cáo nặng viết native SQL trả DTO; cập nhật hàng loạt dùng <code>@Modifying</code> kèm <code>clearAutomatically</code>. Thêm điều kiện lọc mới không còn phải đổi tên method.</p>\n"},{"key":"followup","label":"Sẽ bị hỏi tiếp","role":"next","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>SQL injection có xảy ra với <code>@Query</code> không?</strong> Không nếu dùng tham số (<code>:name</code>); có nếu tự nối chuỗi trong native query hoặc truyền tên cột sắp xếp từ người dùng không qua whitelist.</li>\n<li><strong><code>Page</code> vs <code>Slice</code> vs <code>Window</code> (keyset)?</strong> <code>Page</code> đếm tổng, <code>Slice</code> chỉ biết có trang sau, <code>Window</code>/<code>ScrollPosition</code> hỗ trợ keyset scrolling trong Spring Data.</li>\n<li><strong>Derived delete <code>deleteByStatus</code> chạy thế nào?</strong> Nạp từng entity rồi xoá từng cái (có callback) — chậm với nhiều bản ghi; dùng <code>@Modifying</code> JPQL cho bulk.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"traps","label":"Bẫy thường gặp","role":"caution","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Tên derived query dài 6 điều kiện</strong> — khó đọc, khó tối ưu.</li>\n<li><strong><code>@Modifying</code> không <code>clearAutomatically</code></strong> — đọc lại entity thấy giá trị cũ trong cùng transaction.</li>\n<li><strong><code>Page</code> trên bảng trăm triệu dòng</strong> — câu count chiếm phần lớn thời gian.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"sources","label":"Nguồn","role":"reference","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/jpa/reference/jpa/query-methods.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Spring Data JPA — Query Methods</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/jpa/reference/jpa/specifications.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Spring Data JPA — Specifications</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/data-access/jdbc/core.html#jdbc-JdbcClient\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Spring Framework — JdbcClient</a></li>\n</ul>\n"}]}